# Files that exist for building and handoff, never for serving.
#
# Everything in the repo root is deployed and publicly readable by default.
# Before this file, https://www.eurodetailing.com/_build/gen_membership.py,
# /HANDOFF.md and /chats/chat1.md all returned 200 — which meant the pricing
# rationale, the internal design transcripts, and a handoff note saying the
# membership prices were unconfirmed proposals were all readable by anyone.
#
# Nothing on the live pages references any of these; the gallery data is read
# at build time and baked into gallery.html, not fetched at runtime.

_build/
chats/
HANDOFF.md
PRODUCT.md

# The retired 2026-05 Claude Design prototype. /project and /project/* already
# 301 to the homepage; this stops the files being uploaded at all.
project/
